[Unit]
Description=Nightly ClamAV scan of new files
Documentation=file:///home/buntu/Projects/Docker/Antivirus/README.md

[Timer]
# Inside the maintenance window: fastpi wakes beefy at 03:55 and the window holds it up until 04:45 (Server/9-Night-Schedule.md). A night asleep is skipped; the marker stays, so the next run catches up.
OnCalendar=*-*-* 04:05

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
